# The farm console, if this deployment publishes one reachable from the
# storefront. Unset by default: a console that is not exposed to the internet is
# the normal case (ADR-0016), and advertising a URL that does not resolve is
# worse than listing nothing.
#
# When set, the console appears in the navigation overlay's ПУЛЬТ territory —
# never in the storefront's masthead, because the app bars do not cross.
# VITE_CONSOLE_URL=http://localhost:5174
